T*
(interactions with treatment response. Adherence to the daily reporting protocol remained) Tj
T*
(high across all study arms. Long-term effects beyond the 21-day window could not be) Tj
T*
(assessed in this preliminary design. These findings suggest that the analgesic signal) Tj
T*
(observed with turmeric does not exhibit clear dose-response relationships within the) Tj
